  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.16 - Analyzer precision hardening\n\n            Changed:\n            - Hardened AM002 explicit mapping nullability analysis and fixes for repeated MapFrom, NullSubstitute, resolver/converter, ForPath, and nullable receiver cases\n            - Hardened AM006 ConstructUsing and ConvertUsing ownership boundaries for unmapped destination diagnostics\n            - Hardened AM021 generated conversion calls with fully qualified System APIs\n            - Hardened AM031 ForPath diagnostics while withholding unsafe automatic rewrites\n            - Hardened AM041 chained ReverseMap duplicate fixes onto the manual-review path\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 with targeted AM002, AM006, AM021, AM031, AM041, and RuleCatalog coverage\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.15 - Fixer UX and trust metadata hardening",
